{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46775","headline":"谢南平王赐山鸡 · 齐己","name":"谢南平王赐山鸡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五色文章类彩鸾，楚人罗得半摧残。\n金笼莫恨伤冠帻，玉粒颁慙剪羽翰。\n孤立影危丹槛里，双栖伴在白云端。\n上台爱育通幽细，却放溪山去不难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46775.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46775","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}